From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Date: Wed, 1 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] riscv: k230_defconfig: enable usb gadget, v4l2 and iomux

Enable the USB network and configfs gadget functions (mass storage,
RNDIS, ACM, FunctionFS), V4L2 with the mem2mem test driver, Bluetooth as
a module and the K230 IOMUX and reset drivers, and set the local version
to -k230.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 arch/riscv/configs/k230_defconfig | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/riscv/configs/k230_defconfig b/arch/riscv/configs/k230_defconfig
index 369cd24be..9f3bee5de 100644
--- a/arch/riscv/configs/k230_defconfig
+++ b/arch/riscv/configs/k230_defconfig
@@ -300,3 +300,18 @@ CONFIG_SND_SOC_K230_INNO=y
 CONFIG_SND_SOC_CANAAN_K230_INNO=y
 CONFIG_SND_SOC_CANAAN_K230_AUDIO=y
 CONFIG_K230_PERIDMA=y
+CONFIG_BT=m
+CONFIG_USB_USBNET=y
+CONFIG_USB_CONFIGFS=m
+CONFIG_USB_CONFIGFS_F_FS=y
+CONFIG_USB_CONFIGFS_MASS_STORAGE=y
+CONFIG_USB_CONFIGFS_RNDIS=y
+CONFIG_USB_CONFIGFS_ACM=y
+CONFIG_VIDEO_DEV=y
+CONFIG_VIDEOBUF2_DMA_CONTIG=y
+CONFIG_V4L_TEST_DRIVERS=y
+CONFIG_VIDEO_VIM2M=m
+CONFIG_PINCTRL_K230_IOMUX=y
+CONFIG_RESET_K230=y
+CONFIG_LOCALVERSION="-k230"
+# CONFIG_LOCALVERSION_AUTO is not set
-- 
2.43.0

